        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 5,
      "label": "team_0100_cassiopeia_04",
      "hash64": "BB40B6EA9F220A95",
      "text": "Tu es venu aussi, Clove ?[VAR 0x0114(0009)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 25,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0009"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 6,
      "label": "team_0100_nelke_02",
      "hash64": "04929282C7D56C81",
      "text": "Je m’en serais voulu de manquer l’apogée\\nde cette opération.[VAR 0x0114(001E)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 60,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001E"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 7,
      "label": "team_0100_cassiopeia_05",
      "hash64": "BB40B5EA9F2208E2",
      "text": "Je te remercie aussi pour toute ton aide, Clove.\\nEt je m’excuse d’avoir douté de toi au début...[VAR 0x0114(0009)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 96,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0009"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 8,
      "label": "team_0100_nelke_03",
      "hash64": "04929182C7D56ACE",
      "text": "T’inquiète. C’est « cool, Parecool ».\\c\\nUne fois qu’on sera venus à bout de ce repaire,\\nl’Opération Stardust sera terminée, n’est-ce pas ?[VAR 0x0114(001E)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 37,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 139,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001E"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 9,
      "label": "team_0100_cassiopeia_06",
      "hash64": "BB40B4EA9F22072F",
      "text": "Non, pas encore. Il faudra ensuite affronter\\nle cerveau de la Team Star. Le Big Boss.[VAR 0x0114(0009)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 85,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0009"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 10,
      "label": "team_0100_nelke_04",
      "hash64": "04929482C7D56FE7",
      "text": "Et tu sais où on peut le trouver ?[VAR 0x0114(001E)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 34,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001E"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 11,
      "label": "team_0100_cassiopeia_07",
      "hash64": "BB40B3EA9F22057C",
      "text": "Je pense que le Big Boss se montrera lorsque\\ntous les boss auront quitté la Team Star.[VAR 0x0114(0009)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 86,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0009"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 12,
      "label": "team_0100_nelke_05",
      "hash64": "04929382C7D56E34",
      "text": "Je vois...[VAR 0x0114(001E)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 10,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001E"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 13,
      "label": "team_0100_cassiopeia_08",
      "hash64": "BB40BAEA9F221161",
      "text": "... On commence à voir le bout de cette histoire.\\nJe compte sur vous.[VAR 0x0114(0009)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 69,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0009"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 14,
      "label": "team_0100_nelke_06",
      "hash64": "04929682C7D5734D",
      "text": "Cassiopée a raccroché ? C’est bon ?\\c\\nFort bien.[VAR 0x0114(001E)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 35,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
